OL,3,AWeight-loss jabs boom putting recycling
OL,4,Acentre workers at risk
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It then gets crushed by the recycling
OL,7,Fvehicle and then it comes to us open
OL,8,Fand obviously we've got needles then
OL,9,Ffalling out onto the line putting my
OL,10,Fguys at risk."
